OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed over 'depraved' attack
OL,4,Aon homeless man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for what a judge
OL,7,Fcalled a "barbaric, sick and depraved"
OL,8,Fattack on a homeless man as he lay
OL,9,Funconscious on the ground.
OL,11,FThe victim was kicked, punched and
OL,12,Fstamped on in the unprovoked attack in
OL,13,FScarborough on 3 July last year by
OL,14,FChristian Watson and Fallon Johnston,
OL,15,FYork Crown Court was told.
OL,17,FSentencing Watson, 24, from Kirstall in
OL,18,FLeeds, and Johnston, 20, from
OL,19,FBlackpool, Judge Sean Morris said the
OL,20,Fvictim, from Scarborough, was "lucky to
OL,21,Fbe alive" after the injuries they had
OL,22,Finflicted.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
